", "id": "569025656185476", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473397316_569025659518809_1129938089592913200_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FnhnL26cWlsQ7kNvwFgZxob&_nc_oc=Adn_Ktu3yrPAQkFrv4dOKR2HUmIdT-yzU4vzC2W4jJ-W_G2sgtCsyU_0X4xlb2QsU3A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu3gpsoKA_XiTbqgZkowZ_jEi3DgIXiEblQwvdyz4hJIQ&oe=699D8EAA"}]}, "id": "1339729720412434", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "Screenshot1.png", "id": "1278859143198705", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391924_1278859146532038_7918403453860968819_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4bQYwOpgjmcQ7kNvwGcRMoN&_nc_oc=AdkSg9s9dpq1wVBxUosKZaG7DYMZg98Ukq2RYuyqLtgTyuXo6C__GWwEviW0gi0bogg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvkFP1Nck-niBacEuiodlXIickPwNhdlHKdT_9_pWb9gA&oe=699DAB8D"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot3.png", "id": "653175777576117", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392019_653175780909450_6665210298574887755_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5roZPGANwo0Q7kNvwE6sXEv&_nc_oc=AdnC5dxE4AWhd9A2hAOqLPGleU1yK9AEs3gzaeuY-qJV-ChNAXq7IatlNHEY-kezd9E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afvp_BbGZwdYW0cpz3tblhxPOAcS6UNA7gWFwNUU5q6m8w&oe=699D8CE4"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot2.png", "id": "1813951416117142", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391937_1813951419450475_4779584993365986793_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=f2oVokT3lBUQ7kNvwGPLgI_&_nc_oc=AdkICNyVg8MPf8xE1V4Umvwpb24s7mYPKsURfvcPDjhz3J2re056uu_uKMrpuDTW5-0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvJMvqnd9vuqQPXpj01kUqGk52we9WXOavxyuxt5GBDlQ&oe=699D885F"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot4.png", "id": "633923102942349", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473400793_633923109609015_8038197177680033568_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Mu7WFH2vJnUQ7kNvwEcnE03&_nc_oc=Adl5q1IqoSvyQeXC_7iJqWToyvhv9WWSmO3MgHFtIUqu2lQv1hQqWatDBg13Q_q3Aas&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsIM12Siu2DpFe33dQXpcubwzvoMLcHNmwXA9Fcr_-kUQ&oe=699D85B9"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot5.png", "id": "1236615407829870", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1236615411163203_6793625200968117992_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gAbXeXCoEk4Q7kNvwHB9ksk&_nc_oc=Adkw83t4OhgMB9zQTbjxqsOCzCZnzPAFH3ozcdC-6GiODDyLW7Ls_fEBOoSFOyPYFaY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftogXtarGF7Hlpzhe_cSUQb3V8WsBGSrmvnjEmm530CRg&oe=699D8ECB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverImage.png", "id": "1167487215074082", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391883_1167487218407415_8367507673734608742_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XyMAcGdKxvoQ7kNvwGi5x5O&_nc_oc=AdnAnfaMoOrD2Tv9j9Ttx5GKYmSGSZ4UE46Qq4vi_F_CWq_xZ2ZFpFW61opcjLtI8w4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfstjdZSnrF3DmN346qGkzn7jM273wZU1t8A2l3ZWJrRFg&oe=699D8D5E"}, "display_name": "Magnificent Ships", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Model ship lovers rejoice! This is a collection of six finely-detailed vessels for viewing at both model- and actual-size. Relax and enjoy the Zen-like experience that piloting small boats on liquid provides.  Pick them up for a closer look.  If you desire stimulation, try your hand at competing against a \"ghost-ship\" to capture the most buoys. For fun, try piloting them around inside a house, or even your own living-room via passthrough/mixed-reality.  Leisurely stroll their decks as they sail upon an ocean with dynamic day/night cycle. Each ship includes an \"action\" event while at sea, whereby mighty cannons fire, ship horns bellow, or the submarine dives.\n\nIncluded Ships:\n- Ocean liner: RMS Queen Mary\n- English \"race built\" galleon: The Mermaid (fictional)\n- Zumwalt class destroyer: USS Zumwalt (DDG-1000)\n- Iowa class battleship: USS Iowa (BB-61)\n- Research vessel: RV Calypso\n- German submarine: U-boat Type VII-C/41 (U-659)\n\nDesigned for use with a single controller:\n- Button A/X: change to next ship (long-press for previous)\n- Button B/Y: change to next environment (long-press for previous)\n- Trigger: move in direction controller is pointing.\n- Grip: (model-scale) grab ship , (full-scale) activate action.\n- Thumbstick: (model-scale) control ship, (full-scale) change-time & snap-turn\n- Thumb button: (ship model) double speed, (submarine model) hold to dive, tap to surface", "short_description": "Remote-control model ships in virtual or mixed-reality!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vroom.space/ships/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "VROOM.space", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vroom.space/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9025258787583549"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 8, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "4211684925740530"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1405002918081508"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1821607738519949"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "880528631403650"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1126976229650763"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "6